Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:01.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,road spraying water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a snowstorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:03.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,In snowy parts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.81,0:00:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,of Japan sprinklers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:05.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,are built right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:06.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nozzles down the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:08.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,middle of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:09.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,road spray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:09.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,out water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:10.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's pumped from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:11.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,deep underground where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.83,0:00:12.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,it stays around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:13.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,fifty degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:14.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's warmer than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,snow so the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,snow melts as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:16.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,soon as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:17.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,it lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,The idea started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:19.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,of Nagaoka in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,the nineteen sixties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:22.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,It works there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,because the snow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,falls near freezing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:25.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:25.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:27.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,The catch is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:28.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,it uses lots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,of water and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:29.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,can make the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,ground sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,So newer roads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:32.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep the warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,water in pipes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:34.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,under the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:34.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:35.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,streets in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:36.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,wash their own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,snow away.
